        summary: 'This law establishes the Petroleum and Natural Gas Regulatory Board (PNGRB) to regulate refining, processing, storage, transportation, distribution, marketing, and sale of petroleum, petroleum products, and natural gas, license city gas distribution networks that supply piped cooking gas and CNG to households and vehicles, ensure fair market access to pipelines, and protect consumer interests in the downstream oil and gas sector.',
